{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "251e716242e79e0ba96f86dbbe3eb8bbb227c21f98f688217e4de279c838ab7b", "ja": "（エレナのPV撮影が終わった。\n表情も豊かだったし、いい映像になりそうだな……）", "zh": "（艾琳娜的PV拍完了。\n她的表情这么丰富，应该会有不错的成品……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "a07adfd4b53cad12bf7f4238023cff54320d6ce70b7fb0d1fca2e3ea61910290", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\nねえねえ、どうだった！？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n欸欸，你觉得怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dac61d64a8ce8b3d4c6b19bab85489b7d10e0ff7ad333b1b873389529c56e0b5", "ja": "お疲れさま、エレナ。\nうん、いいPVになりそうだよ。", "zh": "艾琳娜，辛苦了。\n嗯，我觉得会是不错的PV喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "c5119453188969dffabbe9d233d69ea8329a6e649e834d4ee9e4827b862a641f", "ja": "ホント？　ホントに？　世界の裏側とか、\nすーっごく遠いところまで、ちゃんと届くと思う？", "zh": "真的？真的吗？你觉得这可以让住在世界的另一头，\n住得很～远很远的人看到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "183fa58087669bef5a122bb4885c1e60af518d13ad1173e7639ffd78552bee99", "ja": "世界の……裏側？", "zh": "世界的……另一头？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "8a06fade3625c0571f55799252131aea5406aa8c420eac0841804a2287144729", "ja": "ウン！\nだってPVって、たくさんの人が見るんでショ？", "zh": "嗯！\n所谓的PV，不就是要让很多人看见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "860c1609b276b53a142a7d541de66b821885b38a4fc594eea66e4c9aa1a18e98", "ja": "普段は劇場に来られない、遠いところに住んでる\n人たちも、たくさん見てくれるってコトだよネ？", "zh": "平常不能来剧场或是住很远的人，\n要让很多这样的人看到对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f7ceb43614d4f6bc6edebc160e8c52a066feaf28f796241c6214478ee9dca0ac", "ja": "ああ、そうだな……うん。\nもしかしたら、外国の人なんかも見るかもしれないな。", "zh": "对，你说得没错……嗯。\n说不定国外也会有人看到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "a89724dd86decd2e60b742837a71f12509e1b920cfbb7adfebbccd17cf8ff443", "ja": "だよネ？　だからワタシ、すごく気になったノ。\nワタシ、思いっきりダンスするのは得意だけど……。", "zh": "对吧？所以我非常在意呢。\n我虽然擅长尽情跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "0f69369fd8ea832661cf9bf2dc2fd675088593ae6fab35cba1329afbc57b79dc", "ja": "PVって、お客さんは劇場じゃなくて\nカメラの向こうにいるでショ？", "zh": "但PV的观众不是身在剧场，\n而是在镜头的另一端对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "c4f4aa567c28574577fda2ac227426050c3c04f7a366e37c4cf1c6b4741689d5", "ja": "映像だと、んーと……ワタシのダンスの、元気で\nパワフルな感じ？　上手く、出せないカモって……。", "zh": "换成影像的话，嗯……我担心自己的舞蹈\n会不会展现不出充满活力又朝气蓬勃的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1704b0d4b238376d0d26745aa9e0f3e0c9046c59ad20a32a9e2718253752060e", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。\nライブならではの躍動感とか、そういう事かな？", "zh": "哦哦，我懂了。\n你是想说现场才看得到的跃动感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "b26185a98b33d3246fea5ef22674ca3dd0afe3df1f77560b28defd17097206c5", "ja": "そうそう、それだヨー！\nさすが、{$P$}だネ♪", "zh": "对对，就是那个──！\n真不愧是{$P$}呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d2c01998e2fd5af410c8d927d538ae97aade26af88faac793b3dfe9b371addc5", "ja": "確かに、劇場とPVは違うな。でも見せ方が違う分、\n普段見えないところも、見せられるんじゃないか？", "zh": "剧场和PV确实不一样，但既然展现的方式不同，\n不也能表现出平时看不见的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "7ee397425349df7c78ea13869da3c2dff6aa38857bd6a3d8245ae5956b08e824", "ja": "ウン…だからネ、今日はいつもより、ちょっとだけ\n細かいトコロに気をつけてみたんだヨ。", "zh": "嗯……所以我今天，\n比平常都还要注意一些细节呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "c82077c6b767007439e58ce4c45b5ad8ddfb018345ed25dff27e809cef76ae68", "ja": "えっと、なんて言えばいいんだろ？\nいつもは、バーン！って感じで踊るんだケド……。", "zh": "我想想，该怎么说才好，\n平时跳舞都是「砰！」的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "4b6bfbabf2c685c66cdcaee94e902960229bb5976ea5773ebd47930311265c11", "ja": "それだけじゃなくて、ワタシの指先とか、目線とか。\nそういうのでも、気持ちが伝わるようにって！", "zh": "但不只是这样，还有我的指尖或视线……\n我希望自己也能学会用这些来表达自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e7901f0c56eb537c36a5da14a5a7426007929b312d37ed8ba9a3761e6ff1dc38", "ja": "そうだったのか。うん、ちゃんと\nエレナの狙いどおりにできてたと思う。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n嗯，我觉得艾琳娜有达成目标喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "dd0403a03b2f744f9ce66a2123f98a35c3d391009eb352e551ae43095c35cd13", "ja": "ホント？　やったネ♪\nできあがるのが楽しみだナ～、エヘヘ……。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了♪\n真让人期待成品呢～嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5e7643546aa5af9f83ccbce26089fc94e3e49937ca4fab515495213d0498b7dc", "ja": "このPVが評判になって、劇場に\nたくさんの人が来てくれるといいな。", "zh": "希望这个PV会大受好评，\n让许多人来剧场看我们表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "9adb05c1dc880e90198a09e19baed19568cebdb8fd038436a99b971fee48080b", "ja": "そうしたら、ますますはりきっちゃうヨ！\n見てくれた人みんなに、元気になって欲しいもんネ♪", "zh": "这样一来，我就更有干劲了！\n因为我想让每一位观众都充满活力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "f80c0f147a52165a1efa14f9b33092e3b0913609bcf852ead3acd669faa24468", "ja": "でもその前に……ずっと遠い海の向こうのみんなにも、\nハッピーな気持ちを届けたいナ。", "zh": "但在那之前……我想把幸福的心情也分享给\n一直远在大海另一端的人们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "e75bc58ea09e764fe8f84b0a6e89c62905c2067878cda4a2221f9b1dc10607f5", "ja": "劇場みたいに、近くで笑顔は見えないかもだケド。\n心はひとつになれるって、ワタシ、信じてるんだヨ♪", "zh": "虽然不能像在剧场那样，近距离看到对方的笑脸，\n但我相信大家的心，一定可以合而为一♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3106c759c90877c4daf6b2bd4eb00b62ee3ad8fa2721d21626d583111b5d2bb0", "ja": "そうだな。心に、距離は関係ないもんな。", "zh": "是啊，毕竟心灵跟距离是无关的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "a72f76756be81f835b91f5838e81ff94ddef62201078c314395e252229f5e546", "ja": "あ……でも、{$P$}は別だからネ？", "zh": "啊……不过，{$P$}是例外喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1025_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "fddddddcda30b7fb8234d8f126dcbaa74c161a971425cab107e4b72f18bfa1a2", "ja": "{$P$}は、心だけじゃなくて、\n体もワタシの近くにいてくれなきゃダメ！", "zh": "{$P$}不只是心灵，\n身体也得待在我附近才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0084_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "ed7c2a96444a999eea9ff46e21a4d7e5938ad81547ff9bd175e45e35cbbe6e7a", "ja": "ずっとずっとエレナのそばにいて、\n一緒にお仕事しようネ！　約束っ♪", "zh": "你要一直一直陪在艾琳娜身边，\n跟艾琳娜一起工作！说好了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
